# The full splits are rebuilt from the pinned upstream revision by
# `python -m benchmarks.kidbench.prepare` and are never committed: upstream's research-use and
# child-safety notice requires its context travel with any redistribution. Only the example
# splits are tracked, and they are drawn from upstream's benign category.
*
!.gitignore
!example.jsonl
!example_metrics.json
!example_rollouts.jsonl
!example_multi_turn.jsonl
!example_multi_turn_metrics.json
